  "wikitext": "[[File:Next Stop Wiki.png|300px|left]]\n'''Hello and welcome to our Wiki!'''\n\nThis page lists all the main parts of our Wiki. If you want to know more about the game, we suggest you have a look at the [[Hay Day]] page and [[:Category:Game Features|Game Features]] category. To know more about the creators of Hay Day, head over to [[Supercell]].\n\nIf you're interested in contributing, our [[Special:Community|Community Page]] is a good place to start.\n\nWanna talk or ask questions? Check out [https://hayday.fandom.com/f Discussions].\n{{Clr}}",
